- `G:/COMFYUI_Database/Custom_Nodes/comfyui-videohelpersuite/testframework/web/js/testRunner.js` — cleanest plain-JS example with full working pattern
- `G:/COMFYUI_Database/Custom_Nodes/comfyui-easy-use/web_version/v2/easyuse.js` — Vue 3 + createApp pattern, shows icon/tooltip/type fields
- `G:/COMFYUI_Database/Custom_Nodes/comfyui-lora-manager/web/comfyui/autocomplete.js` and `top_menu_extension.js` — confirm `import { app } from "../../scripts/app.js"` path and `extensionManager` sub-API surface
